damaged_code:
```rust
// Framework-supplied base class trait
trait FrameworkController {
    fn handle_request(&self);
    fn log_error(&self);
}

// User struct forced to implement all framework methods
struct MyController;
impl FrameworkController for MyController {
    fn handle_request(&self) { /* my logic */ }
    fn log_error(&self) { /* forced to override/provide logic */ }
}
```

fix:
Decouple the application using the Adapter or Delegation pattern, wrapping the framework behind a minimal interface that you control.
```rust
struct MyController;
impl MyController {
    fn execute(&self) { /* my clean logic */ }
}
// Framework adapter class separately implements FrameworkController
```
